docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:732:## 任务卡字段默认值与例外
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:734:- **Release boundary 默认：** 每张会发版卡为 `independent`（完整 C 组：本卡 `patch + 1` + 版本面集合（以 `compat_version_surface_sync` 为权威；当前三处） + 工具链刷新 `Cargo.lock` + `gh release create`）；`docs`/`audit`/`spike`/`handoff` 卡为 `no-release`。
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:738:- **Security and privacy 默认：** 继承 `GC-07`、`GC-11` 与 `GC-M2-*`。
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:741:- **Version increment 默认：** 会发版卡为 `patch`（本卡完成后 PATCH + 1，无上限）；`no-release` 卡为 `N/A`。
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:742:- **Release write set 默认：** `Inherited`（= ER-08 版本面集合（以 `compat_version_surface_sync` 为权威；当前三处） + `Cargo.lock` + release artifact）；`no-release` 卡为 `N/A`。
