docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:265:## Libra Commit Conventions
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:267:### Stage explicitly; avoid `commit -a`
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:272:# Preferred — narrow, predictable
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:276:# Risky — bundles unrelated working-tree changes and deletions
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:286:### Sign off with `-s`; one `-m`
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:294:### Signing and hooks differ from Git — know these two
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:296:- **Signing is on by default and there is no `-S`.** `libra init` sets `vault.signing=true`, so commits are PGP-signed with the repository vault key (libvault), not GnuPG. `-S` / `--gpg-sign` are not exposed; `--no-gpg-sign` opts out per commit.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:297:- **The hook chain is Libra-native and complete.** `.libra/hooks/*.sh|.ps1` runs `pre-commit` → `prepare-commit-msg` → `commit-msg` → commit → `post-commit` (→ `post-rewrite` for `--amend`). `--no-verify` skips all of it; `--disable-pre` skips only `pre-commit`.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:301:## Branching Strategy
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:311:- Branch from `main` (or the team's default branch).
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:312:- Keep branches short-lived (merge within 1-3 days). Delete branches after merge.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:313:- Prefer feature flags over long-lived branches for incomplete work.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:317:### Refs live in SQLite, not files
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:321:- `libra symbolic-ref` operates on **local `HEAD` only**; other symbolic refs are rejected.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:322:- Don't hand-edit ref files — there are none. Use `libra branch`, `libra tag`, `libra switch`, `libra symbolic-ref`.
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:323:- `libra branch` list filters (`--contains` / `--no-contains` / `--merged` / `--no-merged` / `--points-at`), copy (`-c`/`-C`), rename, and upstream set/unset (`-u` / `--unset-upstream`) are supported; `--sort` / `--format` are accepted-but-ignored (use `--json`).
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r07.log:325:### Locked branches are protected
