  2633	## 性能与容量摘要
  2634	
  2635	| 操作 | 单次成本 | 累积成本 | 首个预算 | 验证 |
  2636	|---|---|---|---|---|
  2637	| terminal observe | O(1) indexed upsert | 每 Task/Intent 一行 job | P95 <10 ms | job benchmark |
  2638	| Task source resolve | O(相关对象数) | 不持久化 raw window | ≤256 objects、≤2 MiB redacted bytes | source bounded test |
  2639	| Intent compile input | O(贡献 Task summaries) | 一条 Intent revision | Task 数有硬上限，超出分层/omission | intent scale fixture |
  2640	| Writer | O(new objects + projection rows) | 每 source generation 一 revision | CAS retry ≤3；对象/row 增量有固定上限 | writer probe |
  2641	| Incremental projection | O(new events) | 投影与权威历史线性增长 | batch size 有界 | projection benchmark |
  2642	| Full rebuild | O(all Memory objects) | 无额外权威数据 | 10k Episodes P95 ≤30 s | ignored stable-runner test |
  2643	| Search | FTS O(match postings) + candidate ancestry | FTS external-content index | 10k Episodes P95≤50 ms/P99≤100 ms | memory benchmark |
